      "id": "claim_953f9eaadb1f42c3b14e8a45ada7776b",
      "statement": "HO 01 17 is an HO-3 Louisiana amendatory endorsement, edition 2020-09 and effective 2020-09-01; it applies to property and loss subject to Louisiana law, controls a conflict with the attached policy, preserves unconflicted policy terms, and does not provide coverage unless the policy or endorsement does so.",
