      "statement": "For mixed-cause wind/hail loss, HO 01 17 applies the wind/hail deductible to the wind/hail portion and any other deductible to the remaining covered loss; related damage from one wind or hail event is one occurrence even when discovered later, while separate events may be separate occurrences.",
